sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as 管理员
    participant UI as Web界面
    participant Admin as AdminVideo
    participant Video as Video
    participant Noti as Notification
    participant DB as 数据库

    A->>UI: 打开待审列表
    UI->>Admin: listPending
    Admin->>DB: SELECT videos status=待审
    Admin-->>UI: 待审分页
    A->>UI: 点击通过
    UI->>Admin: approve(videoId)
    alt 非管理员或状态不可审
        Admin-->>UI: code=403/400
    else 待审视频
        Admin->>DB: UPDATE status=已发布
        Admin->>Noti: notifyVideoApproved
        Noti->>DB: INSERT notifications
        Admin-->>UI: code=200
        UI-->>A: 提示已通过审核
    end
